The files contained in this directory represent the prepared data required for subsequent docking analysis.

Molecular docking input files include:

| Component | Description |

|---|---|

| Protein structure | Three-dimensional structure of the target protein (pdbqt) |

| Ligand structure | Three-dimensional structure of the small molecule (pdbqt) |

| Docking configuration | Parameters defining the docking search space and other settings (config.txt) |

| Grid Box | Additional files required by the docking software |

